It is possible to make Dragon scale mail in 3.1 but the method is different
than previous versions.  Now, a dragon will occasionally leave behind a set
of scales when you kill it.  You must use a scroll of enchant armor on these
scales to get scale mail.  Polymorphing a corpse will only give you a food
item.
You cannot make chromatic scale mail.  This question was discussed a few
months ago.  Apparently it was even checked for in the code itself.

